# Three Tree Scribe (CR 603.6c, 700.4, 115.1): "Whenever this creature or another creature you control leaves the battlefield without
# dying, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control." Bot2 exiles one of its own Memnites with Swords to Plowshares (an
# opponent's creature leaves: no trigger), then Bot1's Ornithopter (exiled, not dying: one trigger), then Lightning Bolts Bot1's Memnite
# (it dies: no trigger). The one trigger's target must be a creature Bot1 controls: Bot2's other Memnite and Bot1's Mox Jet are refused,
# and Bot1 puts the counter on the Scribe itself: exactly one counter in all.

